    "zh-CN": "提供条码和二维码的生成与识别能力。支持 QR Code、EAN-13、Code 128、Data Matrix 等多种格式，可自定义尺寸、颜色、纠错等级。",
    "en-US": "Generate and recognize barcodes and QR codes. Supports QR Code, EAN-13, Code 128, Data Matrix and more, with customizable size, color, and error correction levels."
  },
